# Signing material. A release keystore is irreplaceable: lose it and the app can
# never be updated on Play under the same listing, and leak it and someone else can
# sign builds that impersonate yours. Neither the keystore nor its passwords are ever
# committed - CI reads them from GitHub Secrets instead.
*.jks
*.keystore
keystore.properties
release-keystore-backup*

# Plans are working notes, not shipped artifacts.
.hermes/
